  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "While reorganizing my avatars around using the VRC+ avatar lists, I noticed that any avatars I put in either the 4th or 5th VRC+ list slot end up not showing up in the game and become inaccessible. They're still listed on the website favorite avatar lists and can be moved into different lists from there, but otherwise have to be put in one of the first four avatar list slots to even be usable.\n\nEven unfavoriting, refavoriting, and placing them in either VRC+ list 4 or 5 them in game still doesn't make them appear. In fact, they immediately disappear in the Avatar wings for List 4 and 5 when adding to it. They're still listed as being saved on the website despite this.\n\nThe following video showcases the issue between the game and the website.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RJVQQY3_SwI",
